{{Classic Era}}The Northern Desert of Ro is a highly trafficked and popular area that marks the southern edge of the human city of Freeport as well as the northern edge of the vast Desert of Ro. It also represents a major waypoint for the dark races that pass from Neriak to the swamps to the south, and many of their kind can be found here. 

